# ============================================================================
# Internal / WIP experiment tracking — NEVER push these.
# Intermediate hyperparameter-sweep artefacts (tracking docs, per-run result
# dumps, scratch comparison tables) live only locally.  Only *final* writeups
# (e.g. docs/continual_learning/EXPERIMENTS.md with reproducible numbers)
# belong in the repo.
# ============================================================================
docs/continual_learning/EXPERIMENT_MATRIX.md
docs/continual_learning/EXPERIMENT_MATRIX_*.md
docs/continual_learning/internal/
docs/continual_learning/sweep_*.md
EXPERIMENT_LOG*.md
*_sweep_results.md
*_sweep_results.json

# ============================================================================
# PHASER (phase-aware replay) — under-review paper; never push to remote.
# All algorithm code, configs, stage_info JSON, and eval artefacts stay local.
# ============================================================================
AlphaBrain/training/continual_learning/algorithms/rehearsal_based/phaser.py
configs/continual_learning/stage_info/
configs/continual_learning/*phaser*.yaml
scripts/run_continual_learning_scripts/run_phaser_*.sh
scripts/phase_segmentation/
scripts/_phaser_*.sh
scripts/_phaser_*.py

# Sweep / hyperparameter-search artefacts — intermediate, never push.
# Keep frozen recipe yamls (e.g. *_refresh50.yaml); exclude any *_sweep_* /
# *_widepool_* / *_aligned_* style variants.
scripts/run_continual_learning_scripts/run_*_sweep.sh
scripts/run_continual_learning_scripts/run_*_lambda_sweep.sh
configs/continual_learning/*_sweep_*.yaml
configs/continual_learning/*_widepool_*.yaml
configs/continual_learning/*_aligned_*.yaml
*_sweep.py
results/

